  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project CLAUDE.md §6 gotcha 2026-10-20">Brief line 1: `git switch -c task/fm-041 &lt;tip of work/field-mapping-server-write-path-r1&gt;` (385e060e67 when written; use the current tip), then confirm this POML exists on the branch.</constraint>
