  <notes>Placement Justification (CLAUDE.md §10, bff-extensions.md): in the BFF, where the indexing pipeline and RecordCreationService already live; modifications and deletions only; no endpoint, service, background work or package; expected publish delta ≈ 0 (deletions), measured against a fresh master build.
§11: no new surface. No endpoint, service, interface, registration, column or package; LookupColumn/LegacyTextColumn move from SearchIndexNameResolver to RecordTableRules (a relocation). The three questions do not apply (design §14.8).
ADR-008 path A: the payload checks stay in CallerWriteAuthorization; the caller controls one input fewer.
Release note: index-file ignores searchIndexName; a non-allow-listed value no longer gets 400. One adversarial pass plus UAC-r2's scoped check.
Added 2026-11-02 by the scope path (design §14 → UAC-r2 and provisioning reviews → spec FR-40 → this task → TASK-INDEX → owner approval). Awaiting owner approval.</notes>

